# Build and design docs
CLAUDE.md

# The mockups the UI was designed against: artboards, sketches and the
# scripts that drew them. Nothing in the app reads any of it — the pack
# ships only assets/levels and assets/audio, and no script in there writes
# into lib. The screens they describe exist in Dart now, and the reasoning
# behind them is in the comments there, which is the copy that stays true
# when a button changes. Kept on disk to look at, out of history so a
# `git add -A` cannot sweep in three megabytes of stale HTML.
design/

